    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 8:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gidduu sana tuunni biraa guddaan isaa ammas walitti qabame. Yesuusis sababii tuunni sun waan nyaatu hin qabaatiniif barattoota isaa ofitti waamee akkana jedhe;",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.8.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.8.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 8:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "wj"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "\"Sababii isaan guyyaa sadii na bira turanii waan nyaatan tokko illee hin qabneef, ani namoota kanneeniif garaa nan laafa.",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "MRK.8.2",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "MRK.8.2"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.8.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.8.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 8:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "wj"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Yoo ani agabuu isaanii gad isaan dhiise, isaan karaa irratti ni gaggabu; isaan keessaa tokko tokko fagoodhaa dhufaniitii.\"",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "MRK.8.3",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "MRK.8.3"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 8:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Barattoonni isaas deebisanii, \"Namni kam iyyuu gammoojjii kana keessatti buddeena isaan gaʼu eessaa argachuu dandaʼa?\" jedhan.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.8.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.8.4"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 8:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yesuus immoo,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.8.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.8.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "wj"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "\"Isin buddeena meeqa qabdu?\"",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "MRK.8.5",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "MRK.8.5"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "jedhee gaafate.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.8.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.8.5"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p",
        "vid": "MRK 8:5"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Isaanis, \"Torba\" jedhan.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.8.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.8.5"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 8:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Innis akka namoonni sun lafa tataaʼan itti hime. Buddeena torban fuudhee erga galateeffatee booddee kukkutee akka isaan namootaaf dhiʼeessaniif barattoota isaatti kenne; isaanis namootaaf dhiʼeessan.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.8.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.8.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 8:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Akkasumas qurxummii xixinnoo muraasa qabu turan; qurxummii sanas eebbisee akka isaan namootaaf hiraniif barattoota isaatti hime.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.8.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.8.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 8:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Namoonnis nyaatanii quufan. Ergasiis barattoonni hambaa gundoo torba guutuu walitti qaban.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.8.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.8.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 8:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Isaanis gara nama kuma afurii turan. Innis erga of irraa isaan geggeessee booddee,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.8.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.8.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 8:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "barattoota isaa wajjin yommusuma bidiruu yaabbatee biyya Daalmaanutaa dhaqe.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.8.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.8.10"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 8:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Fariisonnis dhufanii Yesuusitti falmuu jalqaban; isa qoruuf jedhaniis mallattoo samii irraa isa irraa barbaadan.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.8.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.8.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 8:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Innis hafuura dheeraa baafatee,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.8.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.8.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "wj"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "\"Dhaloonni kun maaliif mallattoo barbaada? Ani dhuguma isinitti hima; mallattoon tokko iyyuu dhaloota kanaaf hin kennamu\"",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "MRK.8.12",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "MRK.8.12"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "jedheen.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.8.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.8.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 8:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Innis isaan dhiisee bidiruutti deebiʼee gama ceʼe.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.8.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.8.13"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Raacitii Fariisotaa",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 8:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Barattoonnis buddeena tokkicha bidiruu keessaa of biraa qaban sana malee buddeena fudhachuu irraanfatanii turan.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.8.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.8.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 8:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yesuusis,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.8.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.8.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "wj"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "\"Beekkadhaa; raacitii Fariisotaatii fi raacitii Heroodis irraa of eeggadhaa\"",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "MRK.8.15",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "MRK.8.15"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "jedhee isaan akeekkachiise.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.8.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.8.15"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 8:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Isaanis, \"Kun sababii nu buddeena hin qabneef\" jedhanii walii wajjin haasaʼan.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.8.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.8.16"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 8:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yesuusis waan isaan haasaʼan beekee akkana jedhee isaan gaafate;",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.8.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.8.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "wj"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "\"Isin maaliif waaʼee buddeena dhabuu keessanii dudubbattu? Isin amma iyyuu hin argitanii? Yookaan hin hubattanii? Mataa jabaattanii?",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "MRK.8.17",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "MRK.8.17"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.8.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.8.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 8:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "wj"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Isin utuma ija qabdanuu hin argitanii? Utuma gurra qabdanuus hin dhageessanii? Hin yaadattanii?",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "MRK.8.18",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "MRK.8.18"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.8.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.8.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 8:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "wj"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Yeroo ani buddeena shanan sana nama kuma shaniif caccabsetti isin hurraaʼaa gundoo meeqa guutuu kaaftan?\"",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "MRK.8.19",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "MRK.8.19"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p",
        "vid": "MRK 8:19"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Isaanis, \"Kudha lama\" jedhaniin.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.8.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.8.19"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 8:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Innis,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.8.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.8.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "wj"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "\"Yeroo ani buddeena torba nama kuma afuriif caccabsetti hambaa gundoo meeqa guutuu walitti qabdan?\"",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "MRK.8.20",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "MRK.8.20"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "jedhee gaafate.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.8.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.8.20"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p",
        "vid": "MRK 8:20"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Isaanis, \"Torba\" jedhaniin.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.8.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.8.20"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 8:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Innis,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.8.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.8.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "wj"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "\"Isin amma iyyuu hin hubattanii?\"",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "MRK.8.21",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "MRK.8.21"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "jedheen.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.8.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.8.21"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Yesuus Beetisayidaatti Nama Jaamaa Fayyise",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 8:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Isaanis Beetisayidaa dhaqan; jarri tokkos namicha jaamaa tokko fidanii akka inni isa qaqqabuuf Yesuusin kadhatan.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.8.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.8.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 8:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Innis namicha jaamaa sana harka qabee ganda sana keessaa baase. Ija isaattis tufee, harka isaas irra kaaʼee,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.8.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.8.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "wj"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "\"Waa arguu dandeessaa?\"",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "MRK.8.23",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "MRK.8.23"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "jedhee gaafate.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.8.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.8.23"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 8:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Namichis ol ilaalee, \"Namoota nan arga; isaan muka deemu natti fakkaatu\" jedhe.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.8.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.8.24"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 8:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yesuus amma illee harka isaa ija namichaa irra kaaʼe. Iji namichaas ni baname; agartuun isaa ni deebiʼeef; waan hundas sirriitti arge.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.8.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.8.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 8:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yesuusis namichaan,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.8.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.8.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "wj"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "\"Gara ganda sanaa seentee waan kana nama tokkotti illee hin himin\"",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "MRK.8.26",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "MRK.8.26"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "jedhee gara mana isaatti isa erge.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.8.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.8.26"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Phexros Eenyummaa Kiristoos Beeksise",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "r"
      },
      "items": [
